  "description": "Runs Syncfusion .NET MAUI controls on Linux. Syncfusion's platform-neutral build, which Linux apps get, has no native drawing, touch or invalidation; this package supplies them on OpenMaui's Skia renderer. Call .UseLinuxSyncfusion() in place of .ConfigureSyncfusionCore(). SfView-based controls (ListView, TreeView, TabView, effects and the rest) lay out, draw and receive touch, tap, double-tap, right-tap and long-press. Requires your own Syncfusion license; this package does not include or redistribute Syncfusion assemblies.",
